# chrome-baseline transient run outputs (regenerated each run; only baseline/ + _check/ are tracked references)
# 例外:这两张是 verify.sh 每次跑都重写的探针产物(page-check / sticky-check),
# 曾误入库又被 cfe98fe 移出——按文件名单独忽略,不整目录忽略(_check/ 下的
# chk.png / w.png 是入库的参考图,整目录忽略会把将来新增的参考图一起静默吞掉)。
# 包 z2 实测过它会复发:基线早于本规则的分支上,一条 docs commit 夹带了 402KB 截图。
scripts/.baseline/_check/h5-runtime-home.png
scripts/.baseline/_check/sticky-frost.png
scripts/.baseline/current/
scripts/.baseline/current2/
scripts/.baseline/warmup/
scripts/.baseline/final-check/
scripts/.baseline/baseline-*/

